  "finding": "Every full loss on a return whose complete prefix was ready in CPU was the pinned vLLM hybrid lookup: a quick return still had full-attention blocks on GPU without matching Mamba state, the scheduler asked the connector only for tokens beyond that GPU hit, got zero, and then fell back to the boundary all groups agree on (often zero), discarding the CPU copy. Remaining losses were compaction returns whose 528-token Mamba checkpoint is never stored and partial hits at earlier checkpoints. None were evictions.",
